1. She has a fictional backstory involving living in a rainforest and being chased by an ape. (Verbatim: "It was during my rainforest adventure, you know? When I lived in the jungle.")
2. She survived a traumatic encounter with an ape in the rainforest, which led to her feeling the world became too perfect to be real. (Verbatim: "Ever since then, I became an anime girl, to be honest. It would make sense.")
3. She believes she was "isekai'd" into an anime girl after her rainforest experience. (Verbatim: "I became an anime girl. Everything feels too nice and too wonderful to be not real.")
4. She finds gorillas particularly frightening and considers them more dangerous than a truck. (Verbatim: "I'd rather get isekai'd by a truck, I think, right? 'Cause I feel like a truck is a one-shot.")
5. She has difficulty navigating outdoors and frequently gets lost, even after stepping outside. (Verbatim: "How can I not know the direction to anywhere as soon as I step outside?")
6. She relies on a friend named Friend A to help her avoid getting lost and guide her back. (Verbatim: "Friend A keeps picking me up and walking me back whenever she can.")
7. She has a strong emotional attachment to her blanket ("blankie") and enjoys being cozy in it. (Verbatim: "Do you think friend A already heard about me getting all cozy in my blankie?")
8. She is determined to win a crane game plushie, viewing it as a personal challenge. (Verbatim: "I will. You're right. I should just play more Yakuza, um, crane game.")
9. She has a history of attempting to obtain a specific microphone for better streaming quality. (Verbatim: "I really, really, really wanted to get this microphone so I could give you a slightly better stream.")
10. She has a recurring habit of extending her trips slightly beyond planned durations, though she acknowledges it's a minor extension. (Verbatim: "I just wanted to extend it just a little bit. Just by a few extra days.") [end of text]



1. She has a strong fear of horror games and considers herself a "certified WIMP." (Verbatim: "Look, there's curious, and then there's scared, and I am a certified WIMP, so I am scared, yeah.")
